/Author (Wenxin Li) /CreationDate (D:20260507200503+00'00') /Creator (reportlab) /Keywords (CKS, Coordination Knowledge Substrate, concurrent writes, concurrency control, conflict-handling, determinism contract, bounded non-determinism, rule authoring, substrate, AI systems, boundary case, derivation note, A6.11) /ModDate (D:20260507200503+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab PDF Library - \(opensource\)) 
  /Subject (Standalone formalization of the substrate concurrent-write race as an architectural boundary case in the Coordination Knowledge Substrate \(CKS\) pattern. Specifies how CKS handles concurrent writes from multiple cells to overlapping substrate state through human-authored orchestration rules rather than automatic concurrency control.) /Title (Boundary Case: Substrate Concurrent-Write Race as Standalone Architectural Treatment in the Coordination Knowledge Substrate Pattern) /Trapped /False
>>
endobj
